{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1507522-unlikely-encounter","id":1507522,"title":"Unlikely encounter.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-05T17:41:36-07:00","id":1507522,"title":"Unlikely encounter.","content":"Just something hypothetical that came to mind. If a Toreador encountered a Lammasu, a Defiler, or a Boggan, suppose they didn't learn each one's identity right off the bat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-05T19:13:15-07:00","id":1507528,"title":"","content":"Different universe, so to speak, but this sort of thing is what I'm planning a Chronicle on.<br /> <br /> I've prepared so many encounters for Vampire PCs with other splat creatures, I think I've neglected to make interesting encounters with just plain Mortals, but now that I'm sort of fleshing out who the big fish in the city are, that should change.<br /> <br /> Also, according to WhiteWolfWiki, Lammasu and Defilers are the same thing, unless you're referring to some kind of Wyrmspawn?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-05T19:31:11-07:00","id":1507534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1507522-unlikely-encounter?p=1507528#post1507528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Different universe, so to speak, but this sort of thing is what I'm planning a Chronicle on.<br /> <br /> I've prepared so many encounters for Vampire PCs with other splat creatures, I think I've neglected to make interesting encounters with just plain Mortals, but now that I'm sort of fleshing out who the big fish in the city are, that should change.<br /> <br /> Also, according to WhiteWolfWiki, Lammasu and Defilers are the same thing, unless you're referring to some kind of Wyrmspawn?</div> </div> </div> </div>I used both terms, because around here where I live almost nobody knows about &quot;Demons: the fallen&quot; and many only know one of the terms so I used both as a precaution.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}